71, 180, 'track', { patrol: [[1, 371], [-7, 350], [-9, 326], [-4, 305]] }),\n687:  { id: 'bunker', text: 'Get past the bunker covering the track', kind: 'cross', z: 462, marker: [-4, 462] },\n689:  { id: 'rally', text: 'Reach the rally point on the forest road', kind: 'reach', x: 0, z: 549, r: 7 },\n695:  { x: -1, z: 42, r: 6, text: 'The lane leads straight into their machine gun', sub: 'Gaps in the hedges lead to the orchard (left) and the ditch (right)' },\n707:    'Second platoon is pinned south of the village. The road north runs through Saint-Clair, over the river and up through the Bois de Clair, where the enemy has dug in to cover the withdrawal of a flak battery.',\n708:    'You go ahead alone along the sunken lane. Get into the village, clear a way to the bridge and push through the forest. Their 20 mm flak gun in the clearing is shooting up our spotter planes — put a charge on it.',\n4:   splat(x, z, h, slope) -> [mud, grass, forest, cobble]); this module\n9:   splat weights and their heights, puts rock on steep slopes and standing\n48:  const splatCache = new Map();\n50:    const w = def.splat(x, z, height(x, z), 0);\n115:      const w = def.splat(x, z, h, 1 - n[1]);\n144:    geo.setAttribute('splat', new THREE.BufferAttribute(spl.subarray(0, v * 4), 4));\n181:        attribute vec4 splat;\n186:        vSplat = splat;\n298:        // road's joints hold a little everywhere. Not on grass or rock.\n318:        // darken wet ground (the road's stones most: they soak, and shine);","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"82b6e649-833b-4620-a19a-6a48bed495cc","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:21:58.202Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"3:   The player comes up a sunken lane between hedgerows (south, z ≈ 0),\n30:const trenchWallY = (x, z) => trackHeight(x, z) - TRENCH_DEPTH - 0.42;\n52:// Where the ground may be rough: away from roads, paths, trenches, the river\n145:  // small bulges and irregularities (kept off roads, paths and trenches)\n157:  // sunken lane between the hedgebanks\n1