s wet ground — dark, glossy cobbles with water in the joints"," (and, near the eye, real depth: the stones stand proud of their joints, the"," mud keeps its ruts, the march of the view ray through the height maps),"]},{"oldStart":157,"oldLines":6,"newStart":159,"newLines":11,"lines":["     ray on through the glass into a box with a table and a cupboard lit by","     a lamp that throws their shadows (interior mapping), each room drawn","     from its own seed; the curtains drawn back in front glow less ·","+    `windowlight.js` that light leaving the window: a frustum per lit pane","+    round the light of a lamp behind it, drawn in the late pass, each pixel","+    rebuilt from the depth and lit if the line from the lamp to it passes","+    through the pane, as by a glowing window (inverse square, both angles;","+    the normal rebuilt from the neighbours on the same surface) ·","     `sky.js` (the cloud deck: rolls and billows of noise warped by itself,","     the fires' light on its base falling off with distance; drawn after","     the solid scene, so only the sky that shows is shaded), `weather.js`"]}]}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/README.md"]}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"71795d22-9953-4a74-a9cf-7b592326b821","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","root":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","branch":"hedgerow-grass","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":false,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":1,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":1},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.github.io","visibility":"public"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"voho/protocodus.git