{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"de34c313-1d1d-40f4-b0ad-3a13d0cf2b09","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:58:43.100Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"aca1d33e67df77c08846866245a8b157faabfdb8617ed3a1eb9cac3e5556c296","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"b39f9ee5-5bbb-4c62-92a2-6c6990d44bd3","keep":1080,"tail":["1d658dd387177b1f21a633a4a94f2c4655d1fbac41705884bcb39e55f3d4493a","a96d20a34c3dff31076b894a42dbd1133bd74530c207f565fd0c67787167c66a","75309e5c6df621143d50a1f00ecfa3319f1e3728a4ea09f9b65466650e47a061"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1082,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"1fe84785b0d00a89553835311403912dfd839398cea68f850ac2582f82d7eb9e"}
{"parentUuid":"5c4a8dbc-74d1-4b29-9384-0d45cf3ea8c3","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFjk6yebgTWD7Np9Jgry","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I made two more graphics commits on `hedgerow-grass`. Both were checked in a headless browser on the real GPU, the node checks pass, and both merge cleanly into `hedgerow-poc`. Nothing is pushed.\n\n- **371820e3, grass flattened by blasts:** the meadow grass now whips flat in a ring that races outward from a blast, then springs back within half a second. The effect fades beyond about 15 m. In normal-speed frames the motion is too quick to show in a single still. When I froze the shockwave in place, the flattened ring was clearly visible.\n- **8c1bd386, lamplight falling out of the lit windows** (new `windowlight.js`): the rooms behind the windows used to glow, but no light left the houses. Now each lit window casts a warm, window-shaped patch, glazing bars included, onto whatever is in front of it. The shop window lights the wet street and the bicycle leaning there, the café windows light the terrace chairs and table, and standing in front of a lit window warms the rifle in your hands. It costs about 0.3 ms.\n\n**Limits of the window light:**\n- It casts no shadows, so a cart or a soldier between a window and the ground doesn't block the patch.\n- It only appears when the post-processing chain is on, which is the medium and high quality settings.\n- Light from upper-floor windows lands too far out to reach the street, so mostly ground-floor windows show it.\n\nThe shared notes list every commit, and the anti-aliasing merge warning still applies. The test server, the headless browser and my `launch.json` entry are all removed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":240,"cache_read_input_tokens":591471,"output_tokens":518,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":240,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":518,"cache_read_input_tokens":591471,"cache_creation_input_tokens":240,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":240},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"0cb57e70-7579-4aaf-bc46-4be6228cdcdf","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFjk6UtK2yxCkxmYDKLc","requestRef":"de34c313-1d1d-40f4-b0ad-3a13d0cf2b09","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"560e6c89-ec08-44cf-847f-38b2bf9373ce","timestamp":"2026-10-21T16:58:49.321Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
