{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"f6764ad6-1761-4f97-81ed-ce5063932f8a","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:12:30.773Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"aca1d33e67df77c08846866245a8b157faabfdb8617ed3a1eb9cac3e5556c296","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"dcaa8f21-144e-4f4e-90e1-91201a94952a","keep":1235,"tail":["5987c0c7427d53ea4c0958ee43a2b1ab54dbae813c102140e003fc4ee6a5e0a7","3bf87e21720037839a29f2679d36f01d9298d8123359ce15c2597576fe6e262c","75309e5c6df621143d50a1f00ecfa3319f1e3728a4ea09f9b65466650e47a061"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1237,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"f98bfc62ab73e6741ad6e04c2230147817fb822608e761c3cf7607f07ae6a657"}
{"parentUuid":"053435da-f2d2-472c-97af-18a851719bfb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFko7bZJyEYFrbNR8JAi","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I made two more graphics commits on `hedgerow-grass`. Both were checked in a headless browser on the real GPU, the node checks pass, and both merge cleanly into `hedgerow-poc`. Nothing is pushed.\n\n- **b4bc1dae, forked lightning bolts:** strikes used to light the clouds without ever showing a bolt. Now about half of them draw a jagged, forked bolt from the flash in the cloud down to the horizon.\n  - I also changed where each flash appears (`weather.js`): near strikes now flash high in the cloud and far ones low over the horizon, instead of at a random height. The lightning's light and shadows come from the flash, so a near strike now throws short shadows from high up and a far one long shadows. The random numbers are drawn in the same order as before.\n  - A near strike shows a dramatic bolt over the trees. Far ones are often hidden behind the trees around the level, which is realistic.\n- **122cc628, light through the leaves:** a tree between you and a flare, fire or lamp used to stay a dark silhouette. Now light shines through it, strongest where you look towards the light and in the thin outer leaves, while dense crown interiors stay dark. Under a flare, the leaves seen against it glow translucent green. Near fires and lamps the effect is subtle, and the cost is within measurement noise.\n\nI considered distant machine-gun fire across the fields beyond the level. I dropped it because the trees around the level would hide it in almost every view.\n\nThe shared notes list every commit. The test server, the headless browser and my `launch.json` entry are all removed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":233,"cache_read_input_tokens":668255,"output_t