{"parentUuid":"a8b2fa61-355f-45f7-8c72-3f17caedfd00","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFnY87dLdozXN7g2Y3rU","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FWp2NtyRcyziYxB5F9PUPx","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Library/Application REDACTED.md","old_string":"  the late pass with the near rain).\n","new_string":"  the late pass with the near rain).\n- e22787ce rain in gusts (weather.js GUST_GLSL gust() + exported gustAt() on the CPU, integer hash\n  so they agree; scales near streaks, far sheets and splash/crown spawn rates; mean unchanged).\n\nTried and dropped: reflections in window glass via the SSR pass (glassAlpha range in the scene\nalpha). The scene's alpha is not clean enough for a third range: the late/transparent draws\n(rain streaks, particles, grass edges) raise the alpha of ground pixels into the glass band,\nso wet ground got flagged as glass in streaks; the window panes themselves gave only a faint\nglint at grazing angles. Would need a separate G-buffer bit, not the alpha.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1528,"cache_read_input_tokens":657215,"output_tokens":659,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1528,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":659,"cache_read_input_tokens":657215,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1528,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1528},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FWp2NtyRcyziYxB5F9PUPx":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta