{"parentUuid":"5f696855-52aa-4d57-bffd-c4e7f92425ae","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFnxNN3tPTKurBTV1jd9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GAZ6f1GCAr5KPTnjVipVbq","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow && python3 - <<'EOF'\np = 'README.md'\ns = open(p).read()\nold = \"\"\"    rings where drops land, and within 7 m crowns of droplets flung up and\"\"\"\nassert s.count(old) == 1\ns = s.replace(old, \"\"\"    rings where drops land (on the river's surface over its bed), and\n    within 7 m crowns of droplets flung up and\"\"\")\nopen(p, 'w').write(s)\nprint('ok')\nEOF\nfor t in world-check lod-check distance-check ai-check fp-check clutter-check; do printf \"%s: \" $t; node tests/$t.mjs 2>&1 | tail -1 | cut -c1-60; done; cd /Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass && git status --short && git add fun/hedgerow/js/weather.js fun/hedgerow/js/main.js fun/hedgerow/README.md && git commit -q -F - <<'EOF'\nHedgerow graphics: rain splashing on the river\n\nThe rain's splash rings and droplet crowns were placed at the ground's\nheight, which over the river is its bed: they were drawn under the\nwater and hidden by it, so the river took the rain without a splash.\nNow a drop that lands where the water stands over the ground lands on\nthe water's surface (weather.js landY; main.js passes the level's\nwater): the river at the ford and under the bridge is pocked with rings\nand crowns like the street.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nEOF\ngit log --oneline -1 && (git merge-tree --write-tree --name-only hedgerow-poc hedgerow-grass >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo \"merges cleanly into hedgerow-poc\" || echo \"merge conflicts\")","description":"Run checks and commit the river splashes"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence