{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"61c51673-42d6-4641-b6d5-6e8627365382","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:41:27.332Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"aca1d33e67df77c08846866245a8b157faabfdb8617ed3a1eb9cac3e5556c296","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"8b4733f0-d7aa-469b-ad43-3f6215ed8f26","keep":1493,"tail":["60bae18bc370cfa8761ccd0dcccdc93065fba90b76e11b2e6a751693622a281b","153b82b94a235c2b3211162e02a4da1dd6dd359379a7d2d88d5d8b512b829e5a","75309e5c6df621143d50a1f00ecfa3319f1e3728a4ea09f9b65466650e47a061"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1495,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"4ec0584631c4fa2f33c45f9f7b8915391ab21196745fdb2021eb9196c68a5852"}
{"parentUuid":"82d4bf68-15b4-4036-a785-f2b3218f59cd","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFo18LHLfQQb7TH3QXVt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I made two more graphics commits on `hedgerow-grass`. Both were checked in a headless browser on the real GPU, the node checks pass, and both merge cleanly into `hedgerow-poc`. Nothing is pushed.\n\n- **72d69d13, firelight that dances:** fire light used to flicker only in brightness and stay put, so the shadows around the burning truck never moved, though the comment in `lights.js` claimed they did. Now each fire's light sways about 0.2 m with its flames and rises as it flares up, and the shadow-casting light follows it.\n  - In a test with the flicker frozen, moving the light 0.4 m reshaped the light on the truck's cab and shifted shadow edges on the street and wall.\n  - Lamps and lanterns don't move. The fire light holds still while a flare's shadows are being drawn, so the light always matches its shadow map.\n  - It costs nothing extra, because that shadow is redrawn every frame anyway.\n- **91f491b9, rain splashing on the river:** the rain's splash rings and droplet crowns were placed at the ground's height, which under the river is the riverbed, so the water hid them. They now land on the water's surface, so the river at the ford and under the bridge is pocked with rings and crowns like the street. This changes `weather.js`, plus one line in `main.js` passing the level's water to the weather.\n\nI looked into water pouring from gutters and downpipes, but they're baked into the house meshes with no marked points, so I dropped the idea before writing code.\n\nThe branch is now 29 commits ahead of `hedgerow-poc`, and the shared notes list them all. The test server, the headless browser and my `launch.json` entry are all removed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":245,"cache_read_input_tokens":696710,"output_tokens":558,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":245,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":558,"cache_read_input_tokens":696710,"cache_creation_input_tokens":245,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":245},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"291a3dd1-094f-4449-97b7-f94eb3f53d34","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFo17s14B8rU72To9mbf","requestRef":"61c51673-42d6-4641-b6d5-6e8627365382","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"05695e9a-c196-4995-879a-8e5685db1927","timestamp":"2026-10-21T17:41:32.918Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
