{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","hash":"fa957387ea21270d16b5415f6dcc10a3359567c593cb5fb090fae4fa9ae6252c","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Continuing. Next: water running in the street's gutters. The street is cambered, so rain collects along the edges of the cobbles; a narrow, flowing, mirror-like stream there would catch the lamps and fires down the whole street. I can extend the lane distance texture from the ruts round to cover the street."},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01GRC8w8BEQjqorrxumG75i9","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"items":[{"content":"Water running in the street's gutters","status":"in_progress"},{"content":"Verify headless; commit","status":"pending"},{"content":"Clean up browsers and server","status":"pending"}],"scope":"continuation"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Poac9bVVyu9GUWssgFdZp4","name":"Read","input":{"file_path":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass/fun/hedgerow/js/ruts.js"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
