{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","id":"5282bee4-c3ce-44e3-8f01-aae5a1107d1d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:08:02.933Z","version":"2.1.304","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"aca1d33e67df77c08846866245a8b157faabfdb8617ed3a1eb9cac3e5556c296","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"max"}},"base":"5c9d2a22-5b75-4557-abd2-09b71be7752a","keep":1677,"tail":["3dbd08f7390febc9f50826979fa623966500581d91ec30b8ac9b125862f141a0","0893c488e39fadf232b2d24730a1b187a7904c52cbcbe479d93e509202143ccc","204696145f5096a9b69f194d087dba88e46a4a07645ca4295d466a8c5a395b2a"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",1679,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"de0f6b42b15133b05b43c8aff26865d23b0748ca2debeff62cf77f012ad862e3"}
{"parentUuid":"4104fc35-c3d7-4941-8d73-18ff6d47b7ed","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgFq2kQCkANSdFNtdYdRZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I made two more graphics commits on `hedgerow-grass`. Both were checked in a headless browser on the real GPU, the node checks pass, and both merge cleanly into `hedgerow-poc`. Nothing is pushed.\n\n- **a82ee71b, embers drifting off the fires on the wind:** the fires used to throw a few sparks that were gone within a couple of seconds. The particle system can now carry particles on the wind and push them around in eddies. The fires' embers use that: they ride downwind for up to seven seconds, rising and swirling as they cool from yellow to dull red. Downwind of the burning truck there is always a scatter of embers over the street.\n- **71c792c1, charred wood and wrecks smouldering near their fires:** close to a fire, the blackened parts of the burning ruin and its charred beams now glow in the cracks of the char, each patch pulsing slowly. The burnt-out truck and halftrack glow a mottled dull red with heat instead. My first version used the cracked-char pattern on the steel trucks too, which looked like painted lava, so metal now gets the plain heat glow.\n  - This touches `materials.js`, plus one line in `main.js` that passes the fire positions each frame.\n  - The effect is only computed near a fire.\n\nThe branch is now 33 commits ahead of `hedgerow-poc`, and the shared notes list them all. The test server, the headless browser and my `launch.json` entry are all removed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":240,"cache_read_input_tokens":827104,"output_tokens":476,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":240,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":476,"cache_read_input_tokens":827104,"cache_creation_input_tokens":240,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":240},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"3f70e59d-5ce3-4e03-abf4-15b4133b89ce","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgFq2jn1WRgTfdKCsL8aP","requestRef":"5282bee4-c3ce-44e3-8f01-aae5a1107d1d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","attributionMcpServer":"ccd_turn","attributionMcpTool":"wrap_up","type":"assistant","uuid":"97462989-c6df-493c-805c-01ab9b942847","timestamp":"2026-10-21T18:08:08.125Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"max","perTurnEffort":"max","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/vojta/Dev/protocodus.github.io/.claude/worktrees/hedgerow-grass","sessionId":"c33bf617-35bd-4ff6-a907-5e7d748d7fbc","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"hedgerow-poc","slug":"shimmying-swimming-falcon"}
